    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 33,
      "location": "另一段番外閃回:索爾奉召晉見父王,國王在寢宮私下向他透露一項驚人決定——欲立索爾(而非血親皇弟迪恩)為羅特帝亞王位繼承人,並暗示索爾其實並非國王的親生骨肉,而是被收養撫育長大的孩子。索爾震驚不已,國王給他三天時間考慮。",
      "notes": "本章與 FDTXT_032 同屬結局後的番外閃回,揭露索爾的身世之謎(非王室血親、被收養),與正篇尾聲「索爾繼任王位」的伏筆相互呼應。原始腳本此段全數使用代碼「0」交替代表索爾與父王二人對話,依內文語氣與稱謂(「兒臣」「父王」/「朕」「索爾」)逐句判別歸屬;另有兩句代碼「1」插話,內容以「我們」自稱與索爾、國王同席,依語境判斷應為母后,而非正篇代碼 1=哈諾(哈諾未曾在王室私下場合出現),已標記 [?] 並改列為推測稱呼「(母后)」。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_033",
      "title": "第三十三章 — 番外:王座之秘,索爾的身世"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "私下晉見,父子敘舊"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "兒臣索爾,晉見父王陛下。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "text": "你來啦!起來起來,這裡沒有別人,不用多禮。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "多謝父王。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "text": "到這裡來,讓父王好好看看你。這一陣子國務繁忙,我們父子兩個也很久沒聚聚了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "note": "[?] 原始代碼同「哈諾」,依語境(王室私下場合、「我們一家人」)推測為母后插話,存疑",
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "(母后)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "text": "是啊!我們一家人,難得這樣在一起。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "是。"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "王位繼承人的震撼決定"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "text": "索爾,時間過得真快,你已經長得這麼高了。大臣和將領們對你的武藝和能力也讚譽有加,我想,也該是決定王位繼承人的時候了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "是的,父王,想必是由皇弟迪恩接任王位,兒臣不勝欣喜。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "錯了,索爾,朕希望能由你來接任羅特帝亞的王位。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "啊?兒..兒臣我來接任王位?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "text": "是的,索爾。你對朕的決定有什麼疑問嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "兒臣不敢。但......但是,父王,兒臣並未繼承羅特帝亞王家的血脈,照理來說,兒臣以為應該由皇弟迪恩來繼承王位...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "text": "索爾,這是一個屬於強者的時代。只有強者才能掌握軍隊、統治國家,維持世界的和平和人民的福祉。羅特帝亞需要一個強有力的統治者,我相信你能接替我繼承王位——而且也只有你才能繼承王位。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "可是,皇弟他...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "text": "迪恩他和你不一樣。迪恩是個聰明的孩子,可以成為賢明的君主,但是他長得太文弱了,無法穿著重甲、統率大軍在戰場上奔馳。我還記得當我還是個孩子時所發生的事情,所以..為了羅特帝亞王族,為了羅特帝亞王國的人民,我希望你能成為王位繼承人。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "note": "[?] 原始代碼同「哈諾」,依內容「我們把你當成自己親生的孩子撫養長大」判斷應為母后,存疑",
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "(母后)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "text": "是的。索爾,這些年來,我們把你當成自己親生的孩子撫養長大,這件事也是經過慎重考慮之後才決定的,希望你能夠答應。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "兒臣..兒臣..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "羅特帝亞國王"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "text": "我就知道你會一時無法接受,這樣吧,三天之後,你再給我考慮的結果,當然了,我希望能夠聽到肯定的答覆。你先回去休息吧。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "..是的。兒臣告退。"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/73c4f2f23b11/scenes/1"
    }
